			<v n="1">Then Job answered and said :</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">and break me in pieces with words ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">are you not ashamed to wrong me ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">my error remains with myself .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">and make my disgrace an argument against me ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">and closed his net about me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">I call for help , but there is no justice .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">and he has set darkness upon my paths .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">and taken the<crossref let="c" cid="c18019009.2" />crown from my head .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">and my hope has he pulled up like a tree .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">and<crossref let="e" cid="c18019011.1" />counts me as his adversary .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">and encamp around my tent .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">and<crossref let="i" cid="c18019013.2" />those who knew me are wholly estranged from me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">my close<crossref let="k" cid="c18019014.2" />friends have forgotten me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">I have become a foreigner in their eyes .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">I must plead with him with my mouth for mercy .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">and I am a stench to the children of<crossref let="n" cid="c18019017.2" />my own mother .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">when I rise they talk against me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">and those whom I loved have turned against me .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">and I have escaped by the skin of my teeth .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019021">
			</marker>
			<v n="21">for the hand of God has<crossref let="r" cid="c18019021.1" />touched me !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019022">
			</marker>
			<v n="22">Why are you not satisfied with my flesh ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">Oh that they were<crossref let="t" cid="c18019023.1" />inscribed in a book !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019024">
			</marker>
			<v n="24">they were engraved in the rock forever !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019025">
			</marker>
			<v n="25">and at the last he will stand upon the<crossref let="x" cid="c18019025.3" />earth .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019026">
			</marker>
			<v n="26">yet in my flesh I shall<crossref let="y" cid="c18019026.1" />see God ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019027">
			</marker>
			<v n="27">My heart<crossref let="a" cid="c18019027.1" />faints within me !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019028">
			</marker>
			<v n="28">and , ‘ The root of the matter is found in him , ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18019029">
			</marker>
			<v n="29">that you may know there is<crossref let="b" cid="c18019029.1" />a judgment . ”</v>
